          ><div class="instant-rich-text iw07UG0S4MZvJ3MnI instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="text"><p>THE FORMULA</p></div
          ><div class="instant-rich-text iS5O5YsQxQvMmNG80 instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="text"><h2>6 Powerful Botanicals. Zero Herbal Taste.</h2></div
          ><div class="instant-rich-text iysunEIIXbwwdjMFP instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="text"><p>We took six bold botanical extracts and formulated them to virtually disappear into your water—so you get the ritual without turning your favorite water into some nasty herbal drink.</p></div
