              ><div class="i5AlPwScyvuQsebKb" data-instant-type="container"></div></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i4dFZbGPMn0aK5ekW"><h3>Bitter Melon</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iHvOZ1O2URqCNEON2"><p>Probably the last thing you&apos;d expect to taste like nothing.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i36ugTmPjYcgYMe9s"
              ><p>Bitter melon has been used throughout Asian wellness traditions and studied for its potential role in supporting healthy blood-sugar and metabolic function. And its name is accurate: <strong>It is extremely bitter.</strong> That made it one of the biggest formulation challenges. We kept the extract in the formula while designing Special Water so your water can still taste remarkably normal.</p></div
            ></div
          ></div
