            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifF5YeZ8hncF0aW1p"><h3>Japanese Knotweed</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text io5fPkb2vAmFpvB4g"><p>A traditional botanical naturally rich in resveratrol.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIRtLsGS3viiP9Rp3"
              ><p>Japanese knotweed has been used in East Asian botanical traditions for generations and is naturally rich in plant compounds such as resveratrol. We included it as part of the broader botanical system behind The Special Water rather than relying on one &apos;magic&apos; ingredient to do everything. <strong>Concentrated. Simple. And designed to disappear into the water you already drink.</strong></p></div
