            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i0YrhcnGuQ9VZDy35"><h3>Matcha</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9KSzu0kwurDx5R5q"><p>The Japanese classic.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVJ2zeetNW9r9RVXZ"
              ><p>Matcha has been part of Japanese culture for centuries and is naturally rich in catechins and other plant compounds that have made green tea one of the most studied botanicals in modern wellness. We wanted the botanical profile associated with matcha—<strong>without turning your water green or making it taste like tea.</strong> Special Water was built to fit your water, not replace it.</p></div
