            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i9lJy1TtijvQTh0D1"><h3>Turmeric Root</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipYS3Q4hD4nfhtNvI"><p>Ancient botanical. Modern extraction.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iUmxiadspem3KbstF"
              ><p>Turmeric has been used for centuries and is naturally rich in curcuminoids—plant compounds widely studied for their antioxidant properties and role in supporting a healthy inflammatory response. But turmeric normally brings one obvious problem: <strong>the taste.</strong> So we designed it into the formula without making every bottle of water taste like turmeric.</p></div
