            ><div class="if0f2R9L9RAHsoZG5" data-instant-type="container"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iiRaC8wk4LayPQhPm"><p>06</p></div
              ><div class="ipkXKRNPxRaCIUVMM" data-instant-type="container"></div></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iH7uYt7eB32FXeFl9"><h3>Licorice Root</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iqnksKvKDBM1QVfYu"><p>A traditional botanical chosen to complete the formula.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ip8PLq7HsIJhCWdOo"
              ><p>Licorice root has been used across Eastern wellness traditions for centuries and contains a wide range of naturally occurring plant compounds. Rather than treating it as a standalone miracle ingredient, we use it as one component of the six-botanical system behind The Special Water. The goal was never to create another herbal drink. <strong>The goal was to fit all six botanicals into something you&apos;d actually want to drink every day.</strong></p></div
