      ><div class="iwfM8KOS2791FtywF" data-instant-type="container"
        ><div class="instant-rich-text ioHk5LJIxwJrzW0oW instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="text"><h2>The Hard Part Wasn&apos;t Finding Powerful Botanicals.</h2></div
        ><div class="instant-rich-text iNndnVlDf2lLGEoEA instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="text"><h3>It Was Making Them Taste Like Water.</h3></div
        ><div class="iLKGDuUEmGdwL0942 instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ie6xy0xgpiuy4zDof"
            ><p><strong>Bitter melon is bitter. Cinnamon tastes like cinnamon. Matcha tastes like matcha. Turmeric tastes like turmeric.</strong></p></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ivjDUpkBec6XREceP"><p>That wasn&apos;t good enough for us.</p></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iX4QypjrUBQSqiOmw"><p>If The Special Water was really going to become something people could use every day, it couldn&apos;t feel like another supplement they had to choke down.</p></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iGIDkIX0jl7rvThTB"><p>So we worked on the formula until those six botanical extracts could fit into the simplest ritual possible:</p></div></div
        ><div class="iQqlNqfoGHU3d3Zls instant-scroll-trigger instant-scroll-trigger--hidden instant-reveal--transform" data-instant-scroll-into-view-replay="false" data-instant-type="container"
