        ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifkKN8D4ko97lQvrA"><h2>Losing The Weight Was Goal One. Keeping It Off Was The Real Win.</h2></div
        ><div class="iQZw47j0Z4GAL1PYB" data-instant-type="container"></div><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ili6hMTdtSrhnulgg"><p>I still drink Special Water because it fits into something I was already going to do anyway.</p></div
