              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifg11k2yXt2hAISZQ"><h3>What is The Special Water?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iVijSIjuj3KlzFiZE">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="i0AoiA9lS6aMjctnj" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iOHvtcOTnTjnfCnO7"><p>The Special Water is a concentrated, Japanese-inspired botanical water additive built to slip into an everyday weight-management routine. It was developed by our founder after his own experience living in Japan, where he first encountered the idea of turning ordinary water into something that supports your goals.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="irdFNQrIyQSaddCbz" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iowcb8QleEkdhfmui" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iZF8gdYuONKx6Jc0X"><h3>Does it change the taste of water?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iCwGq3vxZgdXalrwI">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="iIZpVoLgAAC73TWlq" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iuujwIZoEaPBQpslg"><p>It&apos;s designed to be extremely subtle. The intention is to enhance the water you already drink without ruining the taste — so you barely notice it&apos;s there.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="ie7rWK0RZ2HyKIcBC" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iXGyWqPdtURY3I4MV" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iCZgp7fCUNK5yZgLJ"><h3>How do I use it?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iC26oMGFKLcrKdL7o">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="itCEiMVVpWvFZ64G4" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i1mpenzYV4pJpT7si"><p>Add two squirts to your normal glass or bottle of water and drink it as you normally would. That&apos;s the whole routine.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="ign0sOubFUQUev9Pe" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iqtIMnrNZhxfuKBfz" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text itDxKj3iSCEuIejg4"><h3>When does the founder personally drink it?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iDWAJPZ3ga4Qrup76">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="ibVdhzO5czubmHmgi" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iXgAEmL0G0UjH6e6L"><p>He personally drinks it in the morning while fasted, often followed by a short 10–15 minute walk. That&apos;s just his personal routine, not a rulebook — feel free to make it your own.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="iPxAQ0ikyrgfyHTKy" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iEMPWJjQxcqPzFoGR" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iM1SdTMpoY8qbsyG1"><h3>What is the Fasted Metabolic Signal?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="iQmQCItrAqtfZ278Q">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="iDxJoQ7nceUQYbZcI" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iHYdgYrvPEVZiRHFd"><p>It&apos;s the founder&apos;s own term for supporting the kind of metabolic environment people associate with fasting — things like lower appetite and steadier blood sugar and insulin. We use it as a way to describe the experience, not as a medical claim, and we don&apos;t cite studies to back it up.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="izlaAMeMmUkoBDMPd" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="iP3jgFCnnrPQFvKbQ" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ifh3jMa8tYSqhHBzf"><h3>What ingredients are inside?</h3></div
              ><div data-instant-type="icon" class="ipWdmuh1DZ8H68Cly">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="instant-icon">
                  <title>plus</title><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"></path>
                </svg></div></button
            ><div class="iMk88hK0VfcYB2Qdu" data-instant-type="accordion-content" style="--instant-accordion-content-height:auto;--instant-accordion-content-width:auto"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text irbbHzTpzAjrCi1hX"><p>A blend of Japanese-inspired botanicals selected specifically for this formula. For the full, up-to-date ingredient list, please refer to the product label.</p></div></div
            ></div
          ><div data-state="closed" class="i1zCkyORaA8E3FDzT" data-instant-type="accordion-item"
            ><button class="i5FAVCxrIezqIspWj" data-instant-type="accordion-header" type="button"
              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVD2gTTi1lUkTuDcc"><h3>Where did the idea come from?</h3></div
